Subject: [PATCH] Eturlia: NeoForge configuration handshake before Brand

Send ModdedNetworkQueryPayload/register before vanilla Brand so
NeoForge clients negotiate ConnectionType.NEOFORGE instead of
treating Eturlia as a vanilla server. Protocol-aware custom payload
codecs, CommonListenerCookie ConnectionType, and listener APIs for
NetworkRegistry.

